1
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:23,620
Four fairies Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter meet together.

2
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:28,560
Winter says:

3
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,100
Sister Spring is loved by everyone.

4
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:40,080
She comes back, trees sprout and grow.

5
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:44,010
Spring says:

6
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:59,520
Must have Sister Summer's sunshine, trees in garden bear sweet fruit, children get summer vacation.

7
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:03,320
Sister Summer says:

8
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:07,840
Children like Sister Autumn most.

9
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:24,360
Autumn makes grape garden ripe golden, full moon night with lanterns, feast.

10
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:30,910
Sister Winter, sad voice:

11
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:38,800
Only you no one loves.

12
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:44,400
Autumn puts hand on Winter's shoulder, comforts:

13
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:50,210
With you there is warm sleep in blanket.

14
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:54,400
Why would anyone not like you?

15
00:01:56,050 --> 00:02:05,520
Four fairies chat happily, not knowing Mother Earth has come beside.

16
00:02:05,690 --> 00:02:08,680
She says:

17
00:02:10,090 --> 00:02:14,170
Each of you has own beauty.

18
00:02:15,130 --> 00:02:19,940
All of you are useful, all are lovable.

